<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When troubles come, go find a chum;</l><l>Together we can overcome!</l><l>Just step away, take time to pray!</l><l>Request compassions of our God.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God grants, God gives, God makes us live;</l><l>We’re His — our ways belong to Him.</l><l>Because, behind the scenes, behind the scenes,</l><l>The heavens rule in everything.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
